          "In children under five the classification is by **WHO 2006 Z-scores** (table below): **wasting** (weight-for-height below -2 SD, acute), **stunting** (height-for-age below -2 SD, chronic) and **underweight** (weight-for-age below -2 SD, composite), with below -3 SD as severe. [WHO 2023]",
