          "**Step 2 - objectives and goals**: write each objective as an **outcome, not an activity** - reduce block MMR from 130 to 90 per lakh live births by 2028, not hold ten camps. [Park 28e]",
          "**Step 3 - assessment of resources**: staff in position against sanction, budget heads, untied funds, equipment, drugs, transport and time - a target fixed before resources are counted is the commonest cause of failure. [Park 28e]",
          "**Step 4 - fixing priorities** by magnitude, seriousness, feasibility, community concern and cost, using **Hanlon's Basic Priority Rating BPR = [(A + 2B) x C] / 3** (size, seriousness, effectiveness each 0-10) and the **PEARL** test (propriety, economics, acceptability, resources, legality). [Park 28e]",
